    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300a LAT The Punk World of Tentacled Monsters \u300bis a hardcore tentacle-themed RPG. Players take on the role of a low-ranking tentacle dweller (Tentacle kun), embarking on a fantastical and heartwarming tentacle-filled life as you encounter a variety of women.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633770/extras/ed71d84357002138bfa46d8ae61ff5ef.poster.avif?t=1754662919\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633770/extras/ed71d84357002138bfa46d8ae61ff5ef.webm?t=1754662919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633770/extras/ed71d84357002138bfa46d8ae61ff5ef.mp4?t=1754662919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a bizarre world where humans and tentacle monsters coexist.<br> You, a bottom-tier tentacle resident, live in a country dominated by humans.<br> One day, you unexpectedly awaken a rare ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To improve your living conditions and to repay the tentacle (Master) who saved you multiple times, you decide to join the Tentacle Self-Rescue Organization.<br> With your rare power, you quickly rise through the ranks and become a core member of the organization, unknowingly turning the gears of history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you stand at the eye of the storm... but what were your original intentions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633770/extras/f93b88050abb77e7c1596c80a8f5134d.poste